sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Note: 3 ContractCertificateChains will be communicated to the CSMS

    CS->>CSMS: Get15118EVCertificateRequest (action = Install, maximumContractCertificateChains = 10, prioritizedEMAIDs = <Configured list EMA IDs>)
    CSMS-->>CS: Get15118EVCertificateResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted<br>exiResponse = <Raw CertificateInstallationRes response for the EV, Base64 encoded><br>remainingContracts must be 2

    CS->>CSMS: Get15118EVCertificateRequest (action = Install, maximumContractCertificateChains = 10, prioritizedEMAIDs = <Configured list EMA IDs>)
    CSMS-->>CS: Get15118EVCertificateResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted<br>exiResponse = <Raw CertificateInstallationRes response for the EV, Base64 encoded><br>remainingContracts must be 1

    CS->>CSMS: Get15118EVCertificateRequest (action = Install, maximumContractCertificateChains = 10, prioritizedEMAIDs = <Configured list EMA IDs>)
    CSMS-->>CS: Get15118EVCertificateResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: status must be Accepted<br>exiResponse = <Raw CertificateInstallationRes response for the EV, Base64 encoded><br>remainingContracts must be 0
